  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IOM Project for Community-led Solution for Inclusive Socio-Economic Resilience towards Sustainable Peace in Conflict-Affected Areas in Ethiopia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contribute to Enhancing social cohesion in the displacement-affected community, Strengthen access to sustainable livelihoods and economic resilience in the displacement affected community&#xc774;&#xc7ac;&#xbbfc; &#xc7ac;&#xc815;&#xcc29;&#xc9c0; &#xc0ac;&#xd68c;&#xd1b5;&#xd569; &#xd5a5;&#xc0c1; &#xbc0f; &#xbd84;&#xc7c1; &#xc704;&#xd5d8; &#xac10;&#xc18c;, &#xc774;&#xc7ac;&#xbbfc;&#xc758; &#xc601;&#xb18d; &#xbc0f; &#xb18d;&#xc678;&#xc18c;&#xb4dd;&#xd65c;&#xb3d9; &#xc9c0;&#xc6d0;&#xc744; &#xd1b5;&#xd55c; &#xacbd;&#xc81c;&#xc801; &#xc9c0;&#xc704; &#xd5a5;&#xc0c1;</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will enhance the capacity of displacement-affected communities for identifying and addressing their social cohesion needds by applying Community Based Planning(CBP) processes. In addition, vulnerable members of the communities will improve their economic status through facilitated opportunities for on-farm and off-farm interventions and increased access to finance.</narrative>
  </description>
